[{"id":575,"name":"远古树精的果实","level":40,"simpleDesc":"帮村民从 /cff0000远古树精/p 身上收集一些 /cffff00药果/p 回来疗伤。","desc":"我之前就是太靠近黑月之塔，才遭到塔内怪物的追捕，幸好你及时出现，我才能活下来。只是我现在身受重伤，暂时无法动弹。森林中有一种 /cff0000远古树精/p，它身上结的 /cffff00药果/p 能够治疗我的伤势，请你收集一些给我吧。","setting":5378,"mapId":926,"npcId":102,"radarMapID":926,"radarGx":28,"radarGy":22,"dialogNotStartNotReady":"","dialogStartNotFinish":"森林中有一种 /cff0000远古树精/p，它身上结的 /cffff00药果/p 能够治疗我的伤势，请你收集一些给我吧。","dialogStartFinish":"这些 /cffff00药果/p 果然有效，用了之后我的伤好多了。虽然我现在伤势好了，但是我怕一个人回去的话又会碰上那些魔兽。","exp":20000,"money2":0,"money3":3000,"acceptJumpMapID":0,"submitJumpMapID":0,"acceptBattleID":0,"submitBattleID":0,"submitNextMissionID":576,"acceptCondition":[{"type":9,"typeName":"CONDITION_MISSION_DONE","not":0,"rawHex":"023e0015e9bb91e9ad94e4b880e6978fe79a84e8bf87e58ebb","missionId":574,"name":"黑魔一族的过去"},{"type":9,"typeName":"CONDITION_MISSION_DONE","not":0,"rawHex":"023e0015e9bb91e9ad94e4b880e6978fe79a84e8bf87e58ebb","missionId":574,"name":"黑魔一族的过去"},{"type":0,"typeName":"CONDITION_NONE","not":0,"rawHex":""}],"submitCondition":[{"type":7,"typeName":"CONDITION_HAVE_ITEM","not":0,"rawHex":"000002020006e88dafe69e9c08","itemId":514,"name":"药果","required":8},{"type":0,"typeName":"CONDITION_NONE","not":0,"rawHex":""},{"type":0,"typeName":"CONDITION_NONE","not":0,"rawHex":""}],"type":0,"series":"","acceptMapId":926,"acceptNpcId":102,"canAccept":1,"_isHelp":false,"wireBase64":"","sources":[{"capture":"2026-09-20T23-27-15-970Z_874aae","seq":36521,"protocol":14501,"sha256":"24e09dbc783d81e1d19756e7cd89e49016c834b4892941346e705ea60d553525","blob":"blobs/24/24e09dbc783d81e1d19756e7cd89e49016c834b4892941346e705ea60d553525.bin","npcId":102,"mapId":926}]}]